<section class="section section-makers full-width" id="makers">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <p class="kicker">{{ section.settings.kicker }}</p>
    <h2>{{ section.settings.heading | newline_to_br }}</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="makers-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      {{ section.settings.body }}
      {%- if section.settings.cta_label != blank and section.settings.cta_link != blank -%}
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ section.settings.cta_link }}">{{ section.settings.cta_label }}</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <div class="maker-materials reveal">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        <div class="fact" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <strong>{{ block.settings.title }}</strong>
          <p>{{ block.settings.text }}</p>
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Ayasa maker shop",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "kicker",
      "label": "Kicker",
      "default": "The industry position"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Most European handpans\nbegin life as an Ayasa shell."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Since 2017, Ayasa has been the world's leading manufacturer of handpan shells. Many respected makers across Europe and beyond build their instruments on Ayasa Ember Steel.</p><p>It matters because of how the shells are made. Ayasa's deep-draw tooling keeps the steel's thickness even across the whole form — something hydroforming, spinning and hand-sinking can't match. An even shell is a predictable shell: tone fields sit where the tuner expects them, tuning is faster and more precise, and the finished instrument holds its voice for years.</p><p>When a maker chooses Ayasa steel, they're not outsourcing craft — they're starting from the most consistent canvas in the industry. The community has a name for what that earned the company: <strong>the makers' maker</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_label",
      "label": "Button label",
      "default": "Visit the Maker Shop",
      "info": "Button is hidden until a link is set (Maker Shop page comes later)."
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_link",
      "label": "Button link"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "material",
      "name": "Material card",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title", "default": "Material" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "text", "label": "Text" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Ayasa maker shop",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "material", "settings": { "title": "Ember Steel", "text": "The signature alloy — stability of nitrided, voice of stainless. 0.9 mm, even across the shell." } },
        { "type": "material", "settings": { "title": "Stainless AISI 430", "text": "Classic stainless character for makers who want long, shimmering sustain." } },
        { "type": "material", "settings": { "title": "DC04", "text": "The traditional deep-drawing steel — warm, familiar, endlessly workable." } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
